      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Three patients with Schönlein-Henoch syndrome developed severe muscle pain in the legs. The pain, so severe that they were bedridden, subsided within a few days and was caused, we believe, by bleeding into the leg muscles."},
